      "title": "Before day one",
      "items": [
        "/job-onboard in Claude Code builds the candidate folder: intake, profile gaps, tracks, master CV and letter, profile fixes, alerts",
        "Every change to rules, facts, answers or master documents breaks the go-live seal until the person signs again"
      ]
    },
